Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:42:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let a theme show back as a prompt in a menu's header

Every settings menu ended with a VOLVER button floating at its
bottom, a button for what the pad's back button already does.

A menuPrompt element (the back button's image, a font and a colour)
makes a menu show that image and BACK right of its title instead of
adding a BACK button; a screen's other buttons stay. Every menu
already goes back with the back button. Without the element menus
keep their BACK button.
